---
SPQR spqr.config template — init-only
Copy this file to `spqr.config` in your project root and fill every value before first propagation.
Each key is a config token from docs/CONFIGURE.md — the authoritative catalogue this map is derived from.
The propagation agent reads these key→value pairs to re-instantiate the matching [TOKEN] inline in core files.
Any token a propagated core file uses must exist here, or propagation fails loudly.
Runtime placeholders ([AGENT], [TICKET_URL], [FILE], [ID]) are NOT config — they are filled per-session and must not appear here.
---

